                "description": "<p>You can purchase replacement soft luggage wheels for the following luggage models <a href=\"https://www.crumpler.com/products/spring-peeper-wheel-unit-set?_pos=1&_psq=wheel&_ss=e&_v=1.0\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.crumpler.com/products/spring-peeper-wheel-unit-set?_pos=1&_psq=wheel&_ss=e&_v=1.0\">here</a>:</p><ul><li>Spring Peeper Check In & Carry On</li><li>Low Level Aviator 70L Suitcase</li><li>Dry Red No. 3</li><li>Dry Red No. 9</li><li>Dry Red No. 12</li><li>Wellington Heist</li><li>Gourmet and Flaked Extravaganza</li></ul><p>Please see the tutorial video below, showing how to replace your wheels. If your luggage model isn’t on the list, it means we’re unable to provide replacement parts, as the manufacturer is no longer producing these wheels.<br/><br/>1. You will need a Phillips head screwdriver.<br/>2. Unscrew all screws from the internal wheel plate.<br/>3. Remove the internal wheel plate & the wheel.<br/>4. Replace with the new wheel.<br/>5. Then screw the internal wheel plate back on.</p>",
