            "accordion_QtrD8L": {
              "type": "_accordion",
              "name": "Accordion",
              "settings": {
                "title": "Hard Luggage Wheels",
                "description": "<p>You can purchase replacement hard luggage wheels for the following luggage models <a href=\"https://www.crumpler.com/products/hard-luggage-replacement-wheels\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>:<br/><br/><strong>Vis-À-Vis 54, 68, 78.<br/><br/></strong>Please see the tutorial video below, showing how to replace your wheels. If your luggage model isn’t on the list, it means we’re unable to provide replacement parts, as the manufacturer is no longer producing these wheels.</p><p>1.  You will need a Phillips head screwdriver or a 4mm Allen Key, dependent on the screws that are in your wheel plate.<br/>2. Unscrew all screws from the internal wheel plate.<br/>3. Remove the internal wheel plate & the wheel.<br/>4. Replace with the new wheel.<br/>5. Then screw the internal wheel plate back on.</p>",
